=== apptainer
--- apptainer 
build 	Build an Apptainer image
exec 	Run a command within a container
run 	Run the user-defined default command within a container
shell 	Run a shell within a container
--- apptainer run --
--app 	set an application to run inside a container
--bind 	a user-bind path specification
--- apptainer run --app 
bin/
reads.fq 
results/
science_bridges.sh 
--- singularity instance 
list 	List all running and named Apptainer instances
start 	Start a named instance of the given container image
--- singularity 
build 	Build an Apptainer image
exec 	Run a command within a container
run 	Run the user-defined default command within a container
shell 	Run a shell within a container
=== nf-core
--- nf-core 
interface 	Launch the nf-core interface
modules 	Commands to manage Nextflow DSL2 modules.
pipelines 	Commands to manage nf-core pipelines.
--- nf-core pipelines 
create 	Create a new pipeline.
lint 	Check pipeline code against nf-core guidelines.
list 	List available nf-core pipelines.
--- nf-core pipelines lint --
--dir 	Pipeline directory.
--help 	Show this message and exit.
--release 	Execute additional checks for release-ready workflows.
